 "note": "The Banksia Tavern, 43 Prince Street, Busselton (opened July 2023 in the old Bodega bar): a small bar in a long, narrow single-storey shop on the north side of Prince Street, the first shop east of the laneway. From the Landgate aerial (Oct 2026) and a 2023 photo of the shopfront. Painted parapet front, a cantilevered awning with a teal fascia, grey tiled piers, an aluminium shopfront with highlight glazing, a timber venetian behind the window lettered THE BANKSIA TAVERN in gold, and a glass door at the east end. Plain lettering, no logo. Metres: x left to right as seen from Prince Street (west to east), y back from the shopfront.",
